<title>USA: New York timecharter fixtures - Dec 13.</title>
<headline>New York timecharter fixtures - Dec 13.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pierre L.D. (built 1995) 165,239 dwt del Japan mid-Jan via West Australia redel Cont $13,500 daily Navix.</p>
<p>Golden Falcon (built 1983) 43,219 dwt del Singapore 14-18/12 trip West Australia r/v redel S.Korea/Japan range $9,000 daily Yukong.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
